Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 09:54:28 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.97)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,920] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 14 | Text: 不要跟一群不对的人去天天刀刀你的想法
Segment #2   [00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:03,240] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #3   [00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,140] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为他们妈他是废物
Segment #4   [00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:05,600] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 3  | Text: 他没用
Segment #5   [00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,760] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 你跟一个完全不懂商业的人
Segment #6   [00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,160] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 10 | Text: 你去讲商业模式有用吗
Segment #7   [00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:11,560] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 10 | Text: 你跟一个他妈完全没有目标的人
Segment #8   [00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,260] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 10 | Text: 你跟他讲我们要使命必达
Segment #9   [00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:14,660] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 我们要实现我们的意义
Segment #10  [00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:17,400] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 10 | Text: 我们今年要干多少目标有用吗
Segment #11  [00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,540] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 10 | Text: 你跟一个完全没有狼性的销售
Segment #12  [00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,320] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 5  | Text: 跟他讲哎呀
Segment #13  [00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,640] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 11 | Text: 我们这个月必须要完成我们这个定的
Segment #14  [00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,220] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 4  | Text: 这个销售额
Segment #15  [00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,120] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 3  | Text: 有没有用
Segment #16  [00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,140] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 你跟一个懒得调查的人
Segment #17  [00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,940] | Elapsed:  15.49s | Words: 14 | Text: 你告诉他勤奋的鸟有重视有有用吗
Segment #18  [00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,060] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 没有任何的调用
Segment #19  [00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:31,700] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 就这么多年的创业经历
Segment #20  [00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,840] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 12 | Text: 我得出来深刻的体验就一句话
Segment #21  [00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:37,500] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是你们一定要把时间划在对的人上面
Segment #22  [00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,440] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 同时让不对的人一定要下车
Segment #23  [00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:41,820] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 否则你是不会有结果的
Segment #24  [00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,020] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个视频可能拍的很短
Segment #25  [00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:44,680] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 就40秒
Segment #26  [00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,300] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是他包含了很多整理
Segment #27  [00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,280] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 你们仔细想
Segment #28  [00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,460] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是很多的答案
Segment #29  [00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:50,160] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 你需要自己一个人惊讶心来的时候
Segment #30  [00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,960] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 去想去思考
Segment #31  [00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,000] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是这世界上有几种人
Segment #32  [00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:54,960] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是有一种人
Segment #33  [00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,220] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 他是遇到问题了
Segment #34  [00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,120] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 他喜欢去问答案
Segment #35  [00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:57,960] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 还有一种人
Segment #36  [00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:58,540] | Elapsed:  32.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 他不叫聪明
Segment #37  [00:00:58,540 --> 00:00:59,420] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 他遇到问题以后
Segment #38  [00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,020] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 8  | Text: 他喜欢去花钱买答案
Segment #39  [00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,000] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 就他有付费意识
Segment #40  [00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,240] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 我解决不了的问题
Segment #41  [00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:03,540] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 1  | Text: 不行
Segment #42  [00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:04,300] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 我问高手
Segment #43  [00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:06,120] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 10 | Text: 这高手很快就给我解决了
Segment #44  [00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,600] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 9  | Text: 那雷基尔不也说过吗
Segment #45  [00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,500] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 13 | Text: 你遇到的所有问题都有标准答案的
Segment #46  [00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,340] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 11 | Text: 这个说不定碰到懂的人问一问
Segment #47  [00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:14,320] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 就怎么有点反光
Segment #48  [00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:16,440] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是你遇到懂的人问一问
Segment #49  [00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,200] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 他就解决了
Segment #50  [00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,300] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是真正问题的答案
Segment #51  [00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,640] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 你只能自己行
Segment #52  [00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:22,140] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 问不着也买不到
Segment #53  [00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,520] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 是不是这个道理
Segment #54  [00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:24,680] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 家人们是人
Segment #55  [00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,740] | Elapsed:  49.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
